# Spec 018 AC-7, automatic (spec 013): the tile benchmark's gate at zoom 1 (spec 012's 4 full layers + 300 sprites at
# 60 Hz must still pass with zoom built in), then the same trials at zooms 0.5 and 2, which only measure the limits
# (`bench: zoom Z limits L layers (300 sprites), S sprites (4 layers)`; zooming out is the game's cost choice).
# PC:      nnh run platformer --pc --script examples/platformer/tests/zoom_gate.nnhs
# Console: nnh run platformer --script examples/platformer/tests/zoom_gate.nnhs   (Homebrew Launcher open, press Y)
# Up to about 27000 frames (7.5 minutes) when every trial passes. Screenshots are taken between the gates.
fail-on "] E "

# To the benchmark (level 1 -> bonus -> benchmark), at 4 layers + 300 sprites, zoom 1.
wait 30
tap SELECT
wait 10
tap SELECT
wait 60
screenshot bench-zoom1
wait 30

# The zoom-1 gate: the verdict.
fail-on "bench: FAIL"
tap A
expect "bench: gate started" 10
expect "bench: PASS" 12000
wait 15
screenshot gate-zoom1

# Zoom 0.5 (B): four times the tiles; the limits only.
tap B
expect "bench: zoom 0.50" 10
wait 60
screenshot bench-zoom05
wait 30
tap A
expect "bench: gate started" 10
# The limits line comes in the same frame, just before this one (it is in the saved log).
expect "bench: zoom 0.50 done" 12000
wait 15
screenshot gate-zoom05

# Zoom 2 (B): a quarter of the tiles.
tap B
expect "bench: zoom 2.00" 10
wait 60
screenshot bench-zoom2
wait 30
tap A
expect "bench: gate started" 10
expect "bench: zoom 2.00 done" 12000
wait 15
screenshot gate-zoom2
end
